WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:32.260
Unable to control the Solo Ship, Cosmo
 and the others abandoned it.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:37.780
﻿﻿However, the Earth Union's Scarabelli
﻿as well as the Buff Clan's Galbaba fleet...

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.330
﻿took advantage of the situation
 and tried to seize the Solo Ship.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.320
﻿Cosmo and the others had no choice
﻿but to return to the Solo Ship,

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.250
deactivate the self-destruct
﻿devices and join the battle.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.880
However, they were unable 
to defuse several bombs...

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:02.430
But the Solo Ship's internal power
﻿contained the explosions.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:15.690
<b>Colony of Hatred</b>

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.520
That makes it thirteen!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.400
﻿Cosmo! Eight o'clock, above us!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:52.200
﻿What?!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.860
﻿Ganga Lubu squad, launch!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:02.770
﻿Ganga Lubu Squad!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.000
﻿Two Heavy Mobile Mecha units are coming at us!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:14.780
﻿Roger!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.130
﻿Kasha!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.950
﻿There's a Heavy Mobile Mecha behind us!

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:21.990
﻿Go down!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.050
﻿Cosmo! It's still not going down!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.650
﻿Gadal Rou squad, strike them with the claws!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.730
You're supposed to stop the
 Giant parts from moving!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.430
Don't get conceited!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.810
We're gonna crash!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:20.780
Never mind them, Cosmo! Come back!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:21.440
Why?

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.070
The enemy's main forces are getting close.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.910
There's more of them than before!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:25.740
﻿Roger!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:26.700
﻿Kasha! Gije!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.360
Withdraw!

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:28.740
﻿Roger!

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:41.910
﻿All crafts have landed.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.010
﻿Enter a short DS Drive!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.590
﻿What coordinates{ should I set it to}?

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:47.510
Any subspace level will do.

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.180
All that matters is that we shake off the enemy!

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:49.810
﻿Understood!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.590
DS Drive airspace computer set to random selection!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.050
﻿The power is rising! We're ready for DS Drive!

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.310
They're going to subspace?

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.660
﻿Damn those Logo Dau aliens!

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:15.950
﻿Where are they running to?

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:22.640
﻿The enemy ship has entered subspace flight!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.670
Shall we continue our pursuit right away, Sir Dron?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:28.760
We can't chase them until we've recovered our units.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.250
We could recover the first attack squad later...

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:33.560
There's no need to rush.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:38.790
﻿In this airspace, there's an alien colony
 planet that our forces attacked before.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.070
﻿Go there.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.100
﻿Gije, do you remember?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:54.180
﻿This is that planet you fired sublight
﻿missiles at to lure us there.

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.570
﻿I remember it well.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.370
﻿I can never apologize for what happened.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.450
﻿Bes, are we going to land?

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:01.840
﻿The Ajian forces were wiped out.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.410
There should be some ﻿leftover weapons
 and ammunition like on Caral.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:08.720
I wonder how many people are still alive...

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:09.920
﻿Kasha...

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.130
I just want to defend the innocent, as an Earthling!

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:17.630
I'm sorry.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:23.730
Do they think we're enemies?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:26.360
It can't be helped, it's always like this...

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.610
﻿Their power is low, there wasn't any damage.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:30.310
﻿Bes, are we really landing there?

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:31.970
﻿We need to.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.770
I hope Ajian will be understanding.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.990
﻿Ajian, please respond!

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.660
﻿This is a refugee ship from Solo.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:39.730
﻿We are requesting aid!

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.710
﻿You said that on purpose. Refugee ship...

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.760
That was scary.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.720
You don't look scared at all!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.760
I'm a professional!

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.220
﻿Lou, are you alright?

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.470
Now's not the time, Lou...

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.800
﻿Lin, get everyone to the center of the ship!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.260
﻿Deck! Ashura! Stand up!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.260
Brace for combat!

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.020
We might have to force﻿ our way down there!

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.240
Any response from Ajian?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.160
I can't hear too well...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:16.740
﻿Got it!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:17.890
﻿We're connected!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:19.320
Is this Ajian?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.220
﻿This is a refugee ship from planet Solo!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.980
That was a warning. You're not
 allowed to land on Ajian!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.700
﻿Who are you to...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.660
It's necessary that we land on Ajian!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.390
It's not necessary for us!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.890
﻿You people are devils!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.960
﻿Do you know what the population of Ajian is now?

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.810
﻿Just one hundred thousand!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:42.790
﻿That's all because you came to Ajian!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.950
﻿Get out of here already!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:51.110
﻿Solo Ship, permission to land has
 been granted. Please land at Tonkin.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.320
Are they having an argument?

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:54.160
﻿Hatari, do you know where Tonkin is?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:54.950
﻿Yeah.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.370
﻿We can get there in about twenty minutes.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.670
The initial attack was carried out by civilians.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.330
We didn't violate our promise.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:09.880
It's your job to hold them back.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:16.000
﻿If you don't stick to the plan, the lives
 of your people will be at stake.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.510
In any case, Sir ﻿Guldabra Dron...

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.910
We can't allow the Solo Ship to stay here!

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.800
﻿We'll defeat them on our own, if that's what it takes!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:30.760
That's what we want as well.
 Our interests are the same.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.110
﻿Should I believe that?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.160
Can I really trust you?

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.880
﻿A samurai does not lie.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.650
﻿I have the approval of Supreme Commander Doba.

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:48.230
This will be my own contract as well.
 Show this to Doba afterwards.

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:54.260
﻿This is the greatest expression
 of gratitude I can give.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.430
﻿I understand.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:58.080
I only have to let the Solo Ship dock, right?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.460
﻿That's the idea. We'll attack them there.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.720
﻿So you have an interesting proposal for us?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:19.700
﻿Yes.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.570
﻿If you lend us materials to repair our ship...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.910
We're willing to let off all our civilians here on Ajian.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.790
﻿Bes?

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.400
﻿That's fine.

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.960
A single woman is worth more
 than a thousand missiles to Ajian.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.050
﻿I'm a civilian?

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.020
﻿I'm sure you've noticed how the battles
﻿have increased in magnitude.

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.980
There's no need for you to risk your life.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:55.190
﻿But without me, you can't research
 the Sixth Civilization and the Ide...

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.570
There's no need for that.

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.240
﻿The Ide has already been manifested.

00:09:58.240 --> 00:09:59.490
﻿Gije, you...

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:03.120
This is the only place for me.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.980
As long as your heart doesn't
 change, you can live on Ajian.

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:07.750
And besides...

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.310
﻿It's not certain that we'll die.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.660
It's time to begin the operation...

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:24.680
﻿This way we'll be able to get our hands on the
﻿ Logo Dau aliens' ship and the Giant unharmed!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.780
﻿The missiles don't belong here, turn around!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.400
﻿Okay, okay!

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.100
Take that to point B!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.350
﻿Yes, that's right.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:42.410
﻿What's the situation?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.410
﻿Having proper equipment makes a big difference.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.160
The people of Ajian are helping us as well.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.290
﻿We've both gotten used to discomfort.

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:51.620
You can say that again...

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.590
﻿Have Karala and the others left?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:54.340
﻿Yeah...

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:55.160
﻿It hurts, doesn't it?

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:56.660
That's right.

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.210
﻿Good times are coming, Bes.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:10:58.970
﻿Yeah...

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.770
It's so big!

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.310
﻿Ashura, don't be so noisy.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.480
Pretending you're an adult, "civilian"?

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.150
﻿You...!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.240
Stop it, Deck.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.440
Huh?

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:21.070
﻿What's going on?

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:23.450
No idea...

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.650
﻿Lin, you'd better not move!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.120
﻿But...

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:32.990
It won't open!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.130
﻿It won't open?

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:35.500
﻿Sheryl...

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.050
﻿It's a shame, but we have to take you all hostage.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.720
﻿Hostage?

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:46.960
﻿What?!

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:50.640
This is all for the sake of
 stopping the killings on Ajian!

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:09.360
Huh?

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:11.220
﻿What's going on, are you taking a break?

00:12:11.280 --> 00:12:12.120
﻿Yeah...

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.680
The dock workers wanted to leave and rest.

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.670
Dinner break?

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:16.580
Who knows...

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.290
﻿What's wrong, why aren't you working?

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.080
﻿Bes, the workers on the dock haven't come back.

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:25.220
﻿What?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:31.980
﻿Hatari!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.180
﻿Return to the bridge!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:35.040
﻿Joliver, prepare to launch quickly!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:36.060
﻿What?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.160
Start the normal engine immediately!

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:39.480
What's this about?

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.960
I'm a bit worried...

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.260
We'd better leave this dock as fast as possible.

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.320
You want to leave?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.110
I'll leave this to you!

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:52.200
﻿The Solo Ship started to move!

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:53.370
﻿What?!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.590
Did they figure it out?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.670
﻿Stop them!

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.360
Contact the Commodore. Did he betray us?

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.260
﻿Joliver! The engine's gone critical!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:31.160
﻿Cosmo!

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.190
Launch and dock right away!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.160
﻿Roger! Kasha, let's launch!

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:36.410
﻿Gije isn't here!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.290
﻿Where has he gone to?

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:38.640
﻿He was transporting missiles!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.160
﻿We'll use remote control to dock with the Nova!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.380
The sign won't appear!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:47.590
What's going on?

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.080
Our power is unstable!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:06.400
Did you tell the Solo Ship about our plans?!

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:08.360
﻿You took hostages, didn't you?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:10.570
It was you who made the first move!

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:11.820
﻿We do have hostages!

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.160
﻿There, do you see them?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.870
﻿Is it the Buff Clan?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.580
﻿Yeah.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.210
﻿Bes, the Commodore is contacting us!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:18.850
What?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.540
Hand over the Solo Ship and
﻿the ldeon to the Buff Clan.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.920
﻿If you do that, I'll tell them to stop the attack.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:25.960
﻿What'd you say?!

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.960
﻿I'm responsible for the safety of one
﻿hundred thousand people on Ajian!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:29.930
﻿Commodore!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.220
﻿If the Solo Ship and Ideon are handed
﻿over to the Buff Clan...

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.880
﻿Don't forget that we're holding the women
﻿and children of the Solo Ship hostage!

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:36.930
﻿You bastard!

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.100
﻿If the fighting doesn't stop now,

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:41.640
﻿we'll kill the hostages one by one!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:44.870
﻿And l'm not bluffing!

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.130
﻿Commodore...

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:56.740
﻿Sheryl!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.410
﻿Lin!

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:00.600
﻿Lin!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:02.670
﻿Lin was...

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:03.840
﻿Lin!

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.840
﻿Lin!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.130
﻿Lin! Get a hold of yourself!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.090
﻿Don't die, Lin!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.090
﻿Lin!

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.220
﻿Lin!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.770
﻿The Ideon sign has appeared?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.640
﻿Kasha, let's go ahead and dock!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.560
﻿Roger, rapid docking!

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:37.030
Let's go!

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.010
﻿Don't attack! ﻿Return to the Solo Ship!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:39.870
﻿What are you saying?!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.870
They want us inside the Solo Ship's barrier!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.330
They're slowing down!

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:46.950
Now's our chance to attack! ﻿Take this!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:11.690
﻿Stop!

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:23.830
﻿There's two of them.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.330
Raise your arms!

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:31.090
﻿Lin...

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.160
﻿Lin!

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.180
﻿What is it?

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.280
Something happened at gate 6!

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.490
Hurry up!

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.220
We need help defending the Solo Ship!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.900
﻿There’s no need for that.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.170
Where's the commander?

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.080
﻿We're in the middle of a fight!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:47.150
We can't negotiate until we've
 stopped the Buff Clan's attack!

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:51.060
In that case, hand over the Solo Ship
﻿and Ideon to the Buff Clan!

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:53.560
Stop your useless resistance!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.450
Lin was struck by a stray bullet...

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.200
Lin...

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.570
﻿This can't be...

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.110
This can't be real!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.300
﻿Cosmo! Do something!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.920
People have been taken hostage.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:14.010
They have to be rescued first!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.580
﻿Shut down their barrier!

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:22.060
You can't get them to surrender
 just by talking, Commodore!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.720
﻿Just a second! Hold on!

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:25.890
﻿Solo Ship! Cut your barrier!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:28.310
Another hostage is going to die, Solo Ship!

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:30.440
No, this time it will be ten people! Ten!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.980
﻿Gije, good!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:33.110
﻿Gije?

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.320
﻿We won't let you kill any more, Commodore!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:40.370
﻿You bastard!

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:41.870
How'd you get here?

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:46.120
Can't you understand what a disaster it would
﻿be if we gave the Solo Ship to the Buff Clan?

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:49.580
You dragged Ajian into this, what
 gives you the right to say anything?

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:53.210
We are defending ourselves out of necessity!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.420
﻿Kill them all!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:02.930
Bastard!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.020
﻿Damn you!

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:10.520
﻿You're scum!

00:18:13.820 --> 00:18:15.860
﻿Hatari! We've freed the hostages!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.860
﻿Understood! Commencing the counterattack!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:19.490
Go ahead! Good luck.

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:20.160
﻿Roger!

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:21.520
﻿Why...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.020
﻿Why did we have to get dragged into this?

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:30.580
﻿We didn't choose to get involved either.

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:35.170
Do you want me to finish you off?

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.010
﻿Please...

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:38.690
Gije!

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:39.680
﻿Lin...

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.260
﻿Are you alright?

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:42.260
﻿It's over.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.640
﻿Sheryl...

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:44.560
﻿Lin!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.490
﻿Lin!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.150
﻿What?!

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.360
﻿Lin is dead?

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.300
﻿The hostages are freed, that's all I know.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.230
﻿Lin is dead!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:18:58.900
﻿Damn you, Buff Clan!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.940
﻿Cosmo! The Ideon gauge!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.120
﻿Let's go!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.620
﻿The Giant is coming!

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:11.870
﻿All ships escape!

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.200
﻿Now that Commodore is dead, we'll
﻿have to change our strategy.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:20.420
You won't get away!

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:27.060
﻿Cosmo, I'm sending the Wave Leader Gun!

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:27.550
Take it!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:31.690
﻿The Wave Leader Gun?

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.440
﻿Roger!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.910
﻿Depart at maximum speed!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.280
I've got you!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.500
This is for Lin!

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:33.300
Lin... I never treated you well enough...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:36.630
﻿Why'd you have to die?

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:39.420
Lin!

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:13.920
﻿The Solo Ship's cruel fate had only just begun.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:19.000
The web of Doba's army was inevitably closing in.

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:38.810
The encirclement of our army is about
 1.5 million light years in diameter.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:44.500
No matter what fleet the Logo Dau aliens
 send, they won't be able to escape.

00:21:45.400 --> 00:21:48.660
﻿It's still meaningless unless we
 figure out the enemy's movements.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:53.240
﻿Guldabra Dron's fleet encountered
 them at the Guraba region.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.160
﻿However...

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.120
﻿He was defeated?

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:56.960
﻿Yes sir.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.790
I will not suffer insubordination from my fleets.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:00.420
﻿Yes sir!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.840
"Siege and destroy" is the sole basis of our strategy.

00:22:05.840 --> 00:22:08.090
Make sure all fleet commanders follow it.

00:22:08.550 --> 00:22:09.300
﻿Yes sir!

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:13.760
Arbitrary conduct will not be tolerated.
 The Giant is much more powerful than it seems.

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:19.650
﻿These samurai are too fixated on
 making personal accomplishments.

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:25.190
﻿That's why I've come along...

00:22:25.610 --> 00:22:27.900
﻿As a representative of the Orme Foundation.

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:31.920
﻿I don't think we'll have to use the Ganda Rowa.

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:34.950
﻿The military has a reputation to maintain...

00:22:50.970 --> 00:22:55.100
<i>Entrapped in the Buff Clan's net,
 the Solo Ship cannot rest.</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:23:00.420
<i>﻿The Nova's cockpit is penetrated, and Gije
 has a vision at the brink of death.</i>

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:06.080
<i>Like the manifestation of the Ide,
 the Ideon's light splits the planet in ﻿half.</i>

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.690
<i>﻿The Ide has been invoked.</i>

00:23:09.650 --> 00:23:12.280
<i>﻿Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon,</i>

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.730
<b>T﻿he Space Runaway</b>

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:17.730
<b>Next Episode</b>

